    },
    {
      "id": "ZgKJ_nkKVDVeh3KVvuC-4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 531.537177408879,
      "y": 11669.42947759963,
      "width": 977.1392668321724,
      "height": 594.2908473050985,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bfP",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 373058511,
      "version": 115,
      "versionNonce": 1556703585,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766911850759,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Imagine if This Situation :\n\nYour Spring Boot application is like a mall. The mall has various\nsections, like stores, a food court, and a VIP lounge. Some areas are\nopen to everyone, while others (like the VIP lounge) require special\naccess.\n\n1)In this mall analogy, Spring Security’s DelegatingFilterProxy is the\nmain security gate.\n\n2)This gate ensures that every visitor is routed through the\nappropriate security checkpoints (filters) managed by the \nFilterChainProxy.\n\n3)Each checkpoint in the SecurityFilterChain ensures that only\nauthorized and authenticated visitors access restricted areas.\n\n4)If you clear all the necessary checkpoints, you can freely explore\nthe mall, including the restricted VIP areas.",
      "fontSize": 25.022772518109413,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Imagine if This Situation :\n\nYour Spring Boot application is like a mall. The mall has various sections, like stores, a food court, and a VIP lounge. Some areas are open to everyone, while others (like the VIP lounge) require special access.\n\n1)In this mall analogy, Spring Security’s DelegatingFilterProxy is the main security gate.\n\n2)This gate ensures that every visitor is routed through the appropriate security checkpoints (filters) managed by the \nFilterChainProxy.\n\n3)Each checkpoint in the SecurityFilterChain ensures that only authorized and authenticated visitors access restricted areas.\n\n4)If you clear all the necessary checkpoints, you can freely explore the mall, including the restricted VIP areas.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "VKUFM_sBQP2Xr9g5FpXuV",
      "type": "image",
      "x": 497.77401425133496,
      "y": 12292.030838542898,
      "width": 1154.9748342516248,
      "height": 511.43334754708195,
