    },
    {
      "id": "f0wEz3jug8Gl3TDsHxwis",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 502.0160884624093,
      "y": 19105.636704963166,
      "width": 737,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bfj",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1182133793,
      "version": 125,
      "versionNonce": 1216574031,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766917184454,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "And this is what a filter means -> a filter is exactly a middleware",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "And this is what a filter means -> a filter is exactly a middleware",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "NcZL9OLP3a0mpgAnNDeGw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 501.5422847818031,
      "y": 19174.617820421496,
      "width": 693,
      "height": 375,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bfk",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 319064545,
      "version": 51,
      "versionNonce": 1259141455,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766917227825,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🌊 What Is a Filter? (Plain English)\n\nA filter is a gatekeeper that sits in front of your controller.\n\nIt can:\n\na)Look at the incoming HTTP request\n\nb)Modify it\n\nc)Reject it\n\nPass it forward\n\n👉 Controller never sees the request until filters finish",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🌊 What Is a Filter? (Plain English)\n\nA filter is a gatekeeper that sits in front of your controller.\n\nIt can:\n\na)Look at the incoming HTTP request\n\nb)Modify it\n\nc)Reject it\n\nPass it forward\n\n👉 Controller never sees the request until filters finish",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
