      "text": "🧠 Core Method: doFilter()\ndoFilter(request, response, chain)\n\n\nThis method decides:\n\n❌ Stop request\n\n✅ Continue request (chain.doFilter())",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🧠 Core Method: doFilter()\ndoFilter(request, response, chain)\n\n\nThis method decides:\n\n❌ Stop request\n\n✅ Continue request (chain.doFilter())",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
