      "updated": 1766917645478,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🔥 Very Important Rule\nchain.doFilter(request, response);\n\n\n➡️ Means:\n“I am done, pass request to next filter / controller”\n\nIf you DON’T call it → request STOPS ❌",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🔥 Very Important Rule\nchain.doFilter(request, response);\n\n\n➡️ Means:\n“I am done, pass request to next filter / controller”\n\nIf you DON’T call it → request STOPS ❌",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
