    {
      "id": "8r1yOmLQ5fUWgfZkYNdPK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 469.2712331014568,
      "y": 25565.05382764299,
      "width": 495,
      "height": 450,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bgM",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1957312929,
      "version": 57,
      "versionNonce": 1209705519,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766917904390,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🧠 What Security Filters Do (Step by Step)\n1️⃣ Authentication Filter\n\n->Reads credentials (JWT / username+password)\n\n->Creates Authentication object\n\n2️⃣ SecurityContext Filter\n\n->Stores authenticated user\n\n->Uses SecurityContextHolder\n\n3️⃣ Authorization Filter\n\n->Checks roles / permissions\n\n->Allows or blocks request",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🧠 What Security Filters Do (Step by Step)\n1️⃣ Authentication Filter\n\n->Reads credentials (JWT / username+password)\n\n->Creates Authentication object\n\n2️⃣ SecurityContext Filter\n\n->Stores authenticated user\n\n->Uses SecurityContextHolder\n\n3️⃣ Authorization Filter\n\n->Checks roles / permissions\n\n->Allows or blocks request",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
