      "updated": 1766918868202,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🧠 Why Not Put JWT Logic in Controller?\n\n❌ BAD:\n    \n    @PostMapping(\"/todo\")\n    public Todo createTodo(@RequestHeader String token) {\n    }\n\n\n✔ GOOD:\n\nController assumes user is authenticated\n\nFilter does authentication",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🧠 Why Not Put JWT Logic in Controller?\n\n❌ BAD:\n    \n    @PostMapping(\"/todo\")\n    public Todo createTodo(@RequestHeader String token) {\n    }\n\n\n✔ GOOD:\n\nController assumes user is authenticated\n\nFilter does authentication",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
