      "updated": 1766919073201,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🧩 OncePerRequestFilter (Recommended)\n\nInstead of Filter, use:\n\nOncePerRequestFilter\n\n\nWhy?\n\nPrevents double execution\n\nThread-safe\n\nDesigned for Spring Security",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🧩 OncePerRequestFilter (Recommended)\n\nInstead of Filter, use:\n\nOncePerRequestFilter\n\n\nWhy?\n\nPrevents double execution\n\nThread-safe\n\nDesigned for Spring Security",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
