    {
      "id": "Nor-BXdoyH6EeJLzZuUhB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 464.212029390108,
      "y": 32208.25143312992,
      "width": 748,
      "height": 600,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bgx",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 104571951,
      "version": 79,
      "versionNonce": 456757313,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766919693631,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "doFilter() in Spring is exactly like next() in middleware (Express /\nNode.js).\n\nLet’s break it from first principles, slowly and clearly.\n\n1️⃣ What is a Spring Filter (in one line)\n\nA Spring Filter is a component that intercepts HTTP requests and\nresponses before they reach your controller and after they leave it.\n\nThink of it as a checkpoint in the request pipeline.\n\n2️⃣ The Core Method: doFilter() 🧠\n\nEvery filter implements this method:\n\nvoid doFilter(\n    ServletRequest request,\n    ServletResponse response,\n    FilterChain chain\n)\n\n\nThis is the heart of Spring filters.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "doFilter() in Spring is exactly like next() in middleware (Express / Node.js).\n\nLet’s break it from first principles, slowly and clearly.\n\n1️⃣ What is a Spring Filter (in one line)\n\nA Spring Filter is a component that intercepts HTTP requests and responses before they reach your controller and after they leave it.\n\nThink of it as a checkpoint in the request pipeline.\n\n2️⃣ The Core Method: doFilter() 🧠\n\nEvery filter implements this method:\n\nvoid doFilter(\n    ServletRequest request,\n    ServletResponse response,\n    FilterChain chain\n)\n\n\nThis is the heart of Spring filters.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
