      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766919965279,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "5️⃣ Request Flow (Visual Mental Model)\nClient\n  ↓\n[ Filter 1 ]\n  ↓ chain.doFilter()\n[ Filter 2 ]\n  ↓ chain.doFilter()\n[ Filter 3 ]\n  ↓\n[ DispatcherServlet ]\n  ↓\n[ Controller ]\n  ↓\n[ Service ]\n  ↓\n[ Repository ]\n  ↑\nResponse goes BACK through filters\n\n\n🔥 This is why filters can do before + after logic.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "5️⃣ Request Flow (Visual Mental Model)\nClient\n  ↓\n[ Filter 1 ]\n  ↓ chain.doFilter()\n[ Filter 2 ]\n  ↓ chain.doFilter()\n[ Filter 3 ]\n  ↓\n[ DispatcherServlet ]\n  ↓\n[ Controller ]\n  ↓\n[ Service ]\n  ↓\n[ Repository ]\n  ↑\nResponse goes BACK through filters\n\n\n🔥 This is why filters can do before + after logic.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
