      "updated": 1766922529276,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2️⃣ What Spring Security Does NOT Provide\n\nSpring Security does NOT know:\n\n-Your database schema\n\n-Your users table\n\nYour UserEntity\n\n-Your fields (email, role, status, etc.)\n\nSo YOU must create:\n\nUserEntity   ❌ NOT provided\nUserRepository ❌ NOT provided",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2️⃣ What Spring Security Does NOT Provide\n\nSpring Security does NOT know:\n\n-Your database schema\n\n-Your users table\n\nYour UserEntity\n\n-Your fields (email, role, status, etc.)\n\nSo YOU must create:\n\nUserEntity   ❌ NOT provided\nUserRepository ❌ NOT provided",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
