      "text": "1️⃣ Where is AuthenticationManager?\n👉 Here 👇 (LOGIN ONLY)\n@PostMapping(\"/login\")\npublic String login(@RequestBody Map<String,\nString> req) {\n\n    Authentication auth =\n        new UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken(\n            req.get(\"username\"),\n            req.get(\"password\")\n        );\n\n    authManager.authenticate(auth);  // 👈 HERE\n    return\njwtUtil.generateToken(req.get(\"username\"));\n}\n\nWhat this means\n\nYou are saying:\n\n\"Spring Security, please authenticate this username\n& password\"\n\nYou are NOT authenticating manually.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1️⃣ Where is AuthenticationManager?\n👉 Here 👇 (LOGIN ONLY)\n@PostMapping(\"/login\")\npublic String login(@RequestBody Map<String, String> req) {\n\n    Authentication auth =\n        new UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken(\n            req.get(\"username\"),\n            req.get(\"password\")\n        );\n\n    authManager.authenticate(auth);  // 👈 HERE\n    return jwtUtil.generateToken(req.get(\"username\"));\n}\n\nWhat this means\n\nYou are saying:\n\n\"Spring Security, please authenticate this username & password\"\n\nYou are NOT authenticating manually.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
