      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Let's understand more about Authentication Manager and AuthenticationProvider and \ndifferent type of AuthenticationProvider",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Let's understand more about Authentication Manager and AuthenticationProvider and \ndifferent type of AuthenticationProvider",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "R0c3hkxDjUdAtHl-zpe6e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -315.06096372241416,
      "y": 79421.33965372694,
      "width": 1282.4275330781893,
      "height": 805,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bjf",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 683139087,
      "version": 98,
      "versionNonce": 573424897,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766945025765,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1️⃣ Where is AuthenticationManager?\n👉 Here 👇 (LOGIN ONLY)\n\n@PostMapping(\"/login\")\npublic String login(@RequestBody Map<String, String> req) {\n\n    Authentication auth =\n        new UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken(\n            req.get(\"username\"),\n            req.get(\"password\")\n        );\n\n    authManager.authenticate(auth);  // 👈 HERE\n    return jwtUtil.generateToken(req.get(\"username\"));\n}\n\nWhat this means\n\nYou are saying:\n\n\"Spring Security, please authenticate this username & password\"\n\nYou are NOT authenticating manually.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1️⃣ Where is AuthenticationManager?\n👉 Here 👇 (LOGIN ONLY)\n\n@PostMapping(\"/login\")\npublic String login(@RequestBody Map<String, String> req) {\n\n    Authentication auth =\n        new UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken(\n            req.get(\"username\"),\n            req.get(\"password\")\n        );\n\n    authManager.authenticate(auth);  // 👈 HERE\n    return jwtUtil.generateToken(req.get(\"username\"));\n}\n\nWhat this means\n\nYou are saying:\n\n\"Spring Security, please authenticate this username & password\"\n\nYou are NOT authenticating manually.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
