    {
      "id": "uxvoB0oCRMs-iUCngYB-k",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -329.26401274745854,
      "y": 81237.1593287847,
      "width": 1128.2169978810673,
      "height": 1015,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bjj",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1872321903,
      "version": 90,
      "versionNonce": 821554625,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766945214647,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2️⃣ What does AuthenticationManager do?\nAuthenticationManager = Orchestrator\n\nIt does NOT:\n\ntalk to DB\n\ncheck password\n\nload user\n\nIt only does this 👇\n\nI have an Authentication object.\nWhich AuthenticationProvider can handle it?\n\n3️⃣ Where is AuthenticationProvider?\n👉 You did NOT create it manually\n\nSpring Boot auto-creates:\n\nDaoAuthenticationProvider\n\n\nBecause you have:\n\nUserDetailsService\n\nPasswordEncoder",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2️⃣ What does AuthenticationManager do?\nAuthenticationManager = Orchestrator\n\nIt does NOT:\n\ntalk to DB\n\ncheck password\n\nload user\n\nIt only does this 👇\n\nI have an Authentication object.\nWhich AuthenticationProvider can handle it?\n\n3️⃣ Where is AuthenticationProvider?\n👉 You did NOT create it manually\n\nSpring Boot auto-creates:\n\nDaoAuthenticationProvider\n\n\nBecause you have:\n\nUserDetailsService\n\nPasswordEncoder",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
