      "seed": 1773148879,
      "version": 109,
      "versionNonce": 1209383937,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766945704295,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "8️⃣ Who uses that Authentication?\nSpring Security itself\n\nWhen your controller runs:\n\npublic TodoEntity create(Authentication auth)\n\n\nSpring injects it from:\n\nSecurityContextHolder.getContext().getAuthentication()\n\n9️⃣ VISUAL COMPARISON (VERY IMPORTANT)\nLogin request\n/login\n→ AuthenticationManager\n→ AuthenticationProvider\n→ UserDetailsService\n→ PasswordEncoder\n→ JWT",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "8️⃣ Who uses that Authentication?\nSpring Security itself\n\nWhen your controller runs:\n\npublic TodoEntity create(Authentication auth)\n\n\nSpring injects it from:\n\nSecurityContextHolder.getContext().getAuthentication()\n\n9️⃣ VISUAL COMPARISON (VERY IMPORTANT)\nLogin request\n/login\n→ AuthenticationManager\n→ AuthenticationProvider\n→ UserDetailsService\n→ PasswordEncoder\n→ JWT",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
