      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766949560545,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1️⃣ AuthenticationManager doesn’t authenticate\n\nAuthenticationManager is just:\n\npublic interface AuthenticationManager {\n    Authentication authenticate(Authentication authentication);\n}\n\n\nIt delegates authentication to providers.\n\n2️⃣ Provider selection logic (IMPORTANT)\n\nEach AuthenticationProvider has this method:\n\nboolean supports(Class<?> authentication)\n\n\nSpring loops through providers like this:\n\nfor (AuthenticationProvider provider : providers) {\n    if (provider.supports(auth.getClass())) {\n        return provider.authenticate(auth);\n    }\n}\n\n\n🎯 This is the key mechanism",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1️⃣ AuthenticationManager doesn’t authenticate\n\nAuthenticationManager is just:\n\npublic interface AuthenticationManager {\n    Authentication authenticate(Authentication authentication);\n}\n\n\nIt delegates authentication to providers.\n\n2️⃣ Provider selection logic (IMPORTANT)\n\nEach AuthenticationProvider has this method:\n\nboolean supports(Class<?> authentication)\n\n\nSpring loops through providers like this:\n\nfor (AuthenticationProvider provider : providers) {\n    if (provider.supports(auth.getClass())) {\n        return provider.authenticate(auth);\n    }\n}\n\n\n🎯 This is the key mechanism",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
