      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "So AuthenticationManager->send it to AuthenticationProvider\nlist and then each provider lets Suppose \nDaoAuthenticationProvider.supports(auth.getClass())\n->auth.getClass()->returs UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken\nwhich is Supportes by DaoAuthenticationProvider so it \nreturns true",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "So AuthenticationManager->send it to AuthenticationProvider\nlist and then each provider lets Suppose \nDaoAuthenticationProvider.supports(auth.getClass())\n->auth.getClass()->returs UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken\nwhich is Supportes by DaoAuthenticationProvider so it \nreturns true",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
