        }
      ],
      "updated": 1767016896093,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "6️⃣ Why JWT does NOT use AuthenticationProvider\n\nIn JWT flow:\n\nUsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken(\n    userDetails,\n    null,\n    authorities\n)\n\n\nThis token is already authenticated.\n\nSpring does NOT call AuthenticationManager again.\n\nYou manually place it in:\n\nSecurityContextHolder.getContext().setAuthentication(auth);",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "6️⃣ Why JWT does NOT use AuthenticationProvider\n\nIn JWT flow:\n\nUsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken(\n    userDetails,\n    null,\n    authorities\n)\n\n\nThis token is already authenticated.\n\nSpring does NOT call AuthenticationManager again.\n\nYou manually place it in:\n\nSecurityContextHolder.getContext().setAuthentication(auth);",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
