      "seed": 352839343,
      "version": 36,
      "versionNonce": 413878113,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1767017363878,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "8️⃣ What if multiple providers exist?\n\nSpring tries them in order:\n\n1️⃣ DaoAuthenticationProvider\n2️⃣ JwtAuthenticationProvider\n3️⃣ OAuthAuthenticationProvider\n\n\nFirst one that:\n\nsupports the token type\n\nsuccessfully authenticates\n\n👉 wins.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "8️⃣ What if multiple providers exist?\n\nSpring tries them in order:\n\n1️⃣ DaoAuthenticationProvider\n2️⃣ JwtAuthenticationProvider\n3️⃣ OAuthAuthenticationProvider\n\n\nFirst one that:\n\nsupports the token type\n\nsuccessfully authenticates\n\n👉 wins.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
