      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3️⃣ What about other providers?\nExample: JWT provider (hypothetical)\nsupports(JwtAuthenticationToken.class) → true\nsupports(UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken.class) → false\n\n\n❌ Not selected\n\nOAuth provider\nsupports(OAuth2LoginAuthenticationToken.class) → false\n\n\n❌ Not selected",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3️⃣ What about other providers?\nExample: JWT provider (hypothetical)\nsupports(JwtAuthenticationToken.class) → true\nsupports(UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken.class) → false\n\n\n❌ Not selected\n\nOAuth provider\nsupports(OAuth2LoginAuthenticationToken.class) → false\n\n\n❌ Not selected",
      "autoResize": true,
