      "seed": 542406049,
      "version": 29,
      "versionNonce": 1625203823,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1767018846950,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4️⃣ Why ONLY DaoAuthenticationProvider exists in your app\n\nBecause you have:\n\n@Bean\nUserDetailsService\n@Bean\nPasswordEncoder\n\n\nSpring Boot auto-registers:\n\nDaoAuthenticationProvider\n\n\nYou did NOT define:\n\nOAuth beans\n\nLDAP beans\n\nCustom provider\n\nSo Dao is the only valid match.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4️⃣ Why ONLY DaoAuthenticationProvider exists in your app\n\nBecause you have:\n\n@Bean\nUserDetailsService\n@Bean\nPasswordEncoder\n\n\nSpring Boot auto-registers:\n\nDaoAuthenticationProvider\n\n\nYou did NOT define:\n\nOAuth beans\n\nLDAP beans\n\nCustom provider\n\nSo Dao is the only valid match.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
