      "seed": 1808683599,
      "version": 37,
      "versionNonce": 1319739809,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1767018888799,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "5️⃣ JWT confusion cleared (IMPORTANT)\n\nIn JWT flow, you do this:\n\nnew UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken(\n    userDetails, null, authorities\n)\n\n\nBUT you do NOT pass it to AuthenticationManager.\n\nInstead you do:\n\nSecurityContextHolder.getContext().setAuthentication(auth);\n\n\nSo:\n\nsupports() is never checked\n\nNo provider is used\n\nSpring trusts you",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "5️⃣ JWT confusion cleared (IMPORTANT)\n\nIn JWT flow, you do this:\n\nnew UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken(\n    userDetails, null, authorities\n)\n\n\nBUT you do NOT pass it to AuthenticationManager.\n\nInstead you do:\n\nSecurityContextHolder.getContext().setAuthentication(auth);\n\n\nSo:\n\nsupports() is never checked\n\nNo provider is used\n\nSpring trusts you",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "cIeQvmdDNE5lPhnoVjFBo",
