      "seed": 1883240961,
      "version": 24,
      "versionNonce": 183462767,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1767018958398,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "6️⃣ What if MULTIPLE providers support the same token?\n\nExample:\n\nProviderA supports UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken → true\nProviderB supports UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken → true\n\n\nSpring uses ORDER:\n\nFirst provider in ProviderManager wins\n\n7️⃣ Where does provider order come from?\n\n1️⃣ Auto-configured providers\n2️⃣ Manually registered providers\n3️⃣ @Order annotation\n4️⃣ SecurityFilterChain configuration",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "6️⃣ What if MULTIPLE providers support the same token?\n\nExample:\n\nProviderA supports UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken → true\nProviderB supports UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken → true\n\n\nSpring uses ORDER:\n\nFirst provider in ProviderManager wins\n\n7️⃣ Where does provider order come from?\n\n1️⃣ Auto-configured providers\n2️⃣ Manually registered providers\n3️⃣ @Order annotation\n4️⃣ SecurityFilterChain configuration",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
