    {
      "id": "amIdOyWvzOMmEJ0UL33wb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -426.4533410924804,
      "y": 108503.2296236808,
      "width": 1221,
      "height": 500,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bm3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1618440911,
      "version": 54,
      "versionNonce": 554452911,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1767019087131,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The key misunderstanding (let’s fix this first)\n\nYou are thinking:\n\n“How does supports() know the Authentication object is coming from AuthenticationManager and is meant for DAO?”\n\n❌ That is NOT how it works.\n✅ Reality:\n\nsupports() does not know\n\nsupports() does not care\n\nsupports() does not inspect credentials\n\nsupports() does not know about DAO\n\nIt only answers one yes/no question:\n\n“Can I handle THIS CLASS of Authentication object?”",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The key misunderstanding (let’s fix this first)\n\nYou are thinking:\n\n“How does supports() know the Authentication object is coming from AuthenticationManager and is meant for DAO?”\n\n❌ That is NOT how it works.\n✅ Reality:\n\nsupports() does not know\n\nsupports() does not care\n\nsupports() does not inspect credentials\n\nsupports() does not know about DAO\n\nIt only answers one yes/no question:\n\n“Can I handle THIS CLASS of Authentication object?”",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
