    {
      "id": "_ytaXsjGEgbn_xUcnRA5c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -430.24630974634454,
      "y": 109609.836059711,
      "width": 748,
      "height": 650,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bm6",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 334537583,
      "version": 34,
      "versionNonce": 1253081825,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1767019134131,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1️⃣ YOU create the Authentication object\n\nThis line is everything:\n\nAuthentication auth =\n    new UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken(username, password);\n\n\nAt this moment:\n\nJava type = UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken\n\nNothing else exists yet\n\nNo provider involved yet\n\n2️⃣ AuthenticationManager receives it\nauthManager.authenticate(auth);\n\n\nAuthenticationManager (actually ProviderManager) does not modify the\nobject.\n\nIt just holds a list:\n\nList<AuthenticationProvider> providers",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1️⃣ YOU create the Authentication object\n\nThis line is everything:\n\nAuthentication auth =\n    new UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken(username, password);\n\n\nAt this moment:\n\nJava type = UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken\n\nNothing else exists yet\n\nNo provider involved yet\n\n2️⃣ AuthenticationManager receives it\nauthManager.authenticate(auth);\n\n\nAuthenticationManager (actually ProviderManager) does not modify the object.\n\nIt just holds a list:\n\nList<AuthenticationProvider> providers",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
