    {
      "id": "st7hwUGXbwKdgDxlBw5yx",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -817.707864798145,
      "y": 116483.63205038958,
      "width": 754.5997314453125,
      "height": 595,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bmd",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 849720001,
      "version": 73,
      "versionNonce": 62899791,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1767020954225,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Step-by-Step Execution (Internals Exposed)\n1️⃣ You create an unauthenticated token\nnew UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken(username,\npassword)->Before JWT token generation\n\n\nInternally this sets:\n\nprincipal = username\ncredentials = password\nauthorities = null\nauthenticated = false\n\n\nThis object means:\n\n“Please authenticate this user” ",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Step-by-Step Execution (Internals Exposed)\n1️⃣ You create an unauthenticated token\nnew UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken(username, password)->Before JWT token generation\n\n\nInternally this sets:\n\nprincipal = username\ncredentials = password\nauthorities = null\nauthenticated = false\n\n\nThis object means:\n\n“Please authenticate this user” ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
