      "text": "4️⃣ DaoAuthenticationProvider does validation\n\nInside Spring Security (simplified):\n\nUserDetails user =\nuserDetailsService.loadUserByUsername(username);\n\nif (!passwordEncoder.matches(rawPassword,\nuser.getPassword())) {\n    throw new BadCredentialsException();\n}\n\n\n✔ Username valid\n✔ Password valid",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4️⃣ DaoAuthenticationProvider does validation\n\nInside Spring Security (simplified):\n\nUserDetails user = userDetailsService.loadUserByUsername(username);\n\nif (!passwordEncoder.matches(rawPassword, user.getPassword())) {\n    throw new BadCredentialsException();\n}\n\n\n✔ Username valid\n✔ Password valid",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
