      "text": "Authentication auth =\n                new UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken(\n                    user, null, user.getAuthorities()\n                );\n\n            SecurityContextHolder\n                .getContext()\n                .setAuthentication(auth);\n        }\n\n        chain.doFilter(req, res);",
