      "text": "5️⃣ 🔥 SPRING CREATES A NEW TOKEN HERE 🔥\n\nInside AbstractUserDetailsAuthenticationProvider:\n\nreturn new UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken(\n    userDetails,            // principal\n    null,                   // credentials wiped\n    userDetails.getAuthorities()\n);\n\n\nThis token is:\n\nauthenticated = true\n\n\n🧠 THIS is the token Spring creates internally",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "5️⃣ 🔥 SPRING CREATES A NEW TOKEN HERE 🔥\n\nInside AbstractUserDetailsAuthenticationProvider:\n\nreturn new UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken(\n    userDetails,            // principal\n    null,                   // credentials wiped\n    userDetails.getAuthorities()\n);\n\n\nThis token is:\n\nauthenticated = true\n\n\n🧠 THIS is the token Spring creates internally",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
