      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "jtmXrDnZk7PPfRq-X7m07",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 47.66258070294862,
      "y": 122451.53147146474,
      "width": 737,
      "height": 525,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bnE",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1183180783,
      "version": 47,
      "versionNonce": 1583327425,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1767021936842,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2️⃣ What AbstractAuthenticationToken gives you (THIS is the reason)\npublic abstract class AbstractAuthenticationToken\n        implements Authentication {\n\n\nIt already provides:\n\n✅ authorities storage\n✅ authenticated flag\n✅ getAuthorities()\n✅ isAuthenticated()\n✅ setAuthenticated() (with security checks)\n✅ eraseCredentials() support\n✅ standard equals() / hashCode()\n\n🔑 Key point\n\nAbstractAuthenticationToken is the BASE CLASS Spring expects you to\nextend\n\nEvery core Spring token extends it.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2️⃣ What AbstractAuthenticationToken gives you (THIS is the reason)\npublic abstract class AbstractAuthenticationToken\n        implements Authentication {\n\n\nIt already provides:\n\n✅ authorities storage\n✅ authenticated flag\n✅ getAuthorities()\n✅ isAuthenticated()\n✅ setAuthenticated() (with security checks)\n✅ eraseCredentials() support\n✅ standard equals() / hashCode()\n\n🔑 Key point\n\nAbstractAuthenticationToken is the BASE CLASS Spring expects you to extend\n\nEvery core Spring token extends it.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
