    {
      "id": "bdt3erTI9os5k4j9x3fSl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -959.9484391084546,
      "y": 124485.0641610021,
      "width": 588.4609375,
      "height": 775,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bnI",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 968442337,
      "version": 72,
      "versionNonce": 577993615,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1767022054575,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4️⃣ Why NOT extend UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken\n\nThis is very important.\n\nWhat UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken represents\n\nUsername + Password authentication ONLY\n\nIts meaning is fixed:\n\nprincipal → username / UserDetails\n\ncredentials → password\n\nvalidated by DaoAuthenticationProvider\n\n❌ Why it’s wrong for custom auth / JWT\n\nIf you extend it:\n\nSpring assumes password-based login\n\nDaoAuthenticationProvider may try to process it\n\nSemantics become incorrect\n\nJWT ≠ username/password\nAPI key ≠ username/password\nOTP ≠ username/password\n\nSo extending it is conceptually wrong.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4️⃣ Why NOT extend UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken\n\nThis is very important.\n\nWhat UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken represents\n\nUsername + Password authentication ONLY\n\nIts meaning is fixed:\n\nprincipal → username / UserDetails\n\ncredentials → password\n\nvalidated by DaoAuthenticationProvider\n\n❌ Why it’s wrong for custom auth / JWT\n\nIf you extend it:\n\nSpring assumes password-based login\n\nDaoAuthenticationProvider may try to process it\n\nSemantics become incorrect\n\nJWT ≠ username/password\nAPI key ≠ username/password\nOTP ≠ username/password\n\nSo extending it is conceptually wrong.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
