      "updated": 1767022518159,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🧠 Why this feels confusing\n\nYou see this:\n\nnew MyAuthToken(user, user.getAuthorities());\n\n\nand earlier:\n\nnew MyAuthToken(username, password);\n\n\nand you think:\n\n“Spring knows this is after authentication”\n\n❌ No\n\n👉 YOU are explicitly choosing the constructor",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🧠 Why this feels confusing\n\nYou see this:\n\nnew MyAuthToken(user, user.getAuthorities());\n\n\nand earlier:\n\nnew MyAuthToken(username, password);\n\n\nand you think:\n\n“Spring knows this is after authentication”\n\n❌ No\n\n👉 YOU are explicitly choosing the constructor",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
