      "text": "🔍 What Java does internally\nCase 1️⃣\nnew MyAuthToken(username, password);\n\n\nTypes:\n\n(Object, Object)\n\n\n✔ Matches constructor #1\n✔ Java chooses it at compile time",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🔍 What Java does internally\nCase 1️⃣\nnew MyAuthToken(username, password);\n\n\nTypes:\n\n(Object, Object)\n\n\n✔ Matches constructor #1\n✔ Java chooses it at compile time",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
