      "text": "public MyAuthToken(Object principal, Collection<? extends\nGrantedAuthority> authorities) { super(authorities); this.principal =\nprincipal; this.credentials = null; setAuthenticated(true); } \nHow does it work how does it know which method to call when and where\nbefore authentication and after authentication",
      "fontSize": 34.725200015590524,
