      "originalText": "public MyAuthToken(Object principal, Collection<? extends GrantedAuthority> authorities) { super(authorities); this.principal = principal; this.credentials = null; setAuthenticated(true); } \nHow does it work how does it know which method to call when and where before authentication and after authentication",
